; CodeQL query: Concurrency/LockThis.ql
; CodeQL commit: ae741615f3e178ce61289a651790dc67fcc18e19
; Engine contract: report lock statements whose locked expression is exactly
; `this`. The lock row's value role looks through parentheses, whitespace and
; a leading comment, so `lock ((this))` is reported, as CodeQL's extractor
; drops parentheses. A field read through this, such as `lock (this.sync)`,
; a cast `(object)this`, `this!` and `base` are near misses. The finding is on
; the lock statement's first line; CodeQL reports the `this` access.
(policy :schema-version 1
  :id "bifrost.csharp-codeql-quality.lock-this"
  :name "C# lock on this"
  :message "'this' used in lock statement"
  :severity warning
  :description "Mirrors CodeQL csharp/ql/src/Concurrency/LockThis.ql at commit ae741615f3e178ce61289a651790dc67fcc18e19. Reports lock statements that lock the current instance, which code outside the class can also lock."
  :tags ["csharp" "codeql" "quality" "concurrency"]
  :analysis (analysis :type match :selector
    (rql :schema-version 1
      (language csharp
        (lock :value (text/regex "\\Athis\\z"))))))
